#. Description of the plugin
#: baukasten-login-legal-pages.php
msgid "Puts the privacy policy, terms and imprint under the login form, strips the WordPress header off the login screen, and moves it to a tidy /login/ URL."
msgstr ""

#. Author of the plugin
